        "cooked": "<p><span>[Tachyon: Green 27/27]</span></p><p><span>”Let me scan this clone of mine before you take it out and knowing it’s Energy I can track the larger source”.&nbsp; Using Principle of Science Tachyon has made a Void energy tracker to try to track the source and points it at her Dark self (Inventions: 5 Science: 1 Status: 4).&nbsp; This succeeds with a minor twist and the heroes get a hero point. &nbsp;</span></p><p><span>[Remaining for Round: Bunker]</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
