        "created_at": "2018-06-30T09:10:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Bunker goes into defensive mode, using his military experience to set himself on guard. (Veteran, Power Suit Status, 1, 7, 4) for defend 4.</p><p>The Void energies seem to arc from Dark Tachyon to the transmitter, energisiing her e(restore DT to a d6 minion). The tracker pings wildiy before pointing towards the distant city as it shimmers, a purple crystal glinting at its hert,. And then the city and crystal are gone, an inverted step pyramid appearing in their place.</p><p>Round 3 (Status still green): As you turn to deal with Dark Tachyon, a shadow falls briefly overhead as Dark Legacy drops onto the bridge, his eyes glowing with purple light (d10 minion).</p><p>Dark Tachyon races after the original, attempting to hinder her tracking device (Hinder: Roll 2) and then proceeds to punch her in the side as she grabs for the device (2 damage). Dark Tachyon reduced to d4.</p><p>[Still to act: Environment, Dark Legacy, Bunker, Unity, AZ, Tachyon (Wraith and Legacy)]</p>",
