        "id": 214050,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-06-30T22:05:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>“Huh. That’s a whole lot of void between us and there. And there’s not a lot to work with…” Unity looks around, seeing nothing but emptiness to any side, except the ziggurat in the distance. Finally she looks to the bridge under their feet. “Well, I guess there’s that.”</p>\n<p>She gestures downward, and the entire section of the bridge is enveloped in pink light. It shudders, then detaches, growing a vaguely avian head, wings, and feet. With a hideous cry, it takes flight, making rapid pace toward the strange structure, with all the heroes and their doppelgangers on its back.</p>\n<p>“Woohoo! That worked better than I hoped!” As she turns to grin at her friends, though, the bird’s eyes flicker purple, and the head stretches back and bites her, hard!</p>\n<p>“Owwww! Leggo!” Surprisingly, it obeys and continues its flight as though uninterrupted.</p>\n<p>“Right, ‘strong mind.’  I guess I have to keep my focus here. Ugh, lesson learned.”</p>\n<p>(Principle of the Gearhead: Robotics 3, Creativity 1, Green 6. Pass with a minor twist, which is take 6 damage. Now at 20/26 (yellow).)</p>",
